            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Nancy Assmann"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I always look for quick and easy recipes. Found this one and took it to a ccokout at a friends house. Everyone loved it. The only thing I did different was I used whipped cream cheese and used an electric mixer to whip and served it with everything bagels cut in bite size pieces. It took 5 min. to make. Loved that. A definite keeper.",
            "datePublished": "2011-06-27T12:04:53.343Z"
          },
          {
