            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Patty Fanning"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This certainly isn't very exotic but my family really enjoys this simple dip. We always serve it heated and use Kraft Sharp Old English cheese spread (sold in the little glass jars). Served with soft onion bagels... YUM!",
